
### Create supplier address
POST http://localhost:8081/supplieraddresses
Content-Type: application/json

{
"supplierId": 1,
"streetAddress": "Testikatu 10",
"postalCode": "00100",
"city": "Helsinki",
"country": "Finland"
}

### Get all supplier addresses
GET http://localhost:8081/supplieraddresses

### Get addresses for supplier 1
GET http://localhost:8081/supplieraddresses?supplierId=1

### Get address by ID
GET http://localhost:8081/supplieraddresses/1

### Update address
PUT http://localhost:8081/supplieraddresses/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
"supplierId": 1,
"streetAddress": "Uusi katu 15",
"postalCode": "00200",
"city": "Helsinki",
"country": "Finland"
}

### Delete address
DELETE http://localhost:8081/supplieraddresses/1
